    available: bool
    """False when no predictive `bets[]` have been computed for this event yet. `forecasts[]` can still populate on MLB / NFL / NCAAF / NBA / NCAAB / NHL / tennis. The request is free only when `available` is false and `forecasts` is empty."""
    odds_source: Optional[str]
    """Bookmaker `bets[].market` prices were sourced from. For predictive intelligence this is the assessment's market_book (not a live `?bookmaker=` overlay)."""
    sport: Optional[str]
    """Sport slug for this event."""
    league: Optional[str]
    """League slug for this event, if any."""
    players: Dict[str, Any]
    """Home/away (or p1/p2) participant identification, keyed by role: {role: {name, player_id, team_id}}."""
    has_recommend: Optional[bool]
    """True when at least one bet meets the recommendation threshold; false when none do; null when intelligence has not been computed for this event. For predictive-framework sports a recommendation requires a non-null `tier` derived from `edge`, so this is false while Edge is not yet published (current MLB/soccer/tennis Stage 1)."""
    match_overview: Optional[str]
    """Natural-language pre-game preview of the matchup — form, context, and what to watch. Written before kickoff by a Search-backed overlay on every event sport (MLB, NFL, NCAAF, NBA, NCAAB, NHL, soccer, tennis); sport-shaped queries so tennis does not invent pitchers. The request path only reads the stored row. Null when the pre-kickoff job has not run or the fixture was not eligible."""
    rationale: Optional[List[str]]
    """Event-level factual pre-game matchup chips (injuries, recent form, lineup/availability news — sport-shaped). Written before kickoff; the request path only reads the stored row. Null when not generated."""
    intelligence_updated_at: Optional[str]
    """ISO-8601 UTC timestamp of the most recent change anywhere in this payload — the maximum of the per-bet `computed_at` values for predictive-framework sports. Because individual markets are only rewritten when they move, use the per-bet `computed_at` to reason about a specific bet rather than this event-level maximum."""
    bets: List[BetIntelligence]
    """One entry per priced bet token on the predictive intelligence surface. Outcomes of the same market sum to 1."""
    forecasts: List[ForecastWager]
    """Forecasted Over/Under player-prop wagers for this event from the same rate model as `GET /v1/intelligence/forecasts`. `selected` marks the top-conviction rows that also appear on the daily slate; the rest of the event catalog is included with `selected: false`. Empty when the sport is outside MLB / NFL / NCAAF / NBA / NCAAB / NHL / tennis, or no strictly-matched two-way main is in range (props) / no ranked two-way moneyline (tennis). Same wager object as the slate — see `ForecastWager`."""
    matchup: Optional[Dict[str, Any]]
    """Not returned. Use `GET /v1/events/{id}/stats` for pitcher/lineup Data."""


